# Service images build from the Twitter root; each Dockerfile copies only
# .mvn/, mvnw, the root pom, twitter_shared/ and its own service dir.
# Anything else is kept out of the context, so private files never reach the daemon.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
frontend/
e2e/
docker/
certs/
security-private/
**/docs/
**/seed-images/
**/*.md
docker-compose*.yml
.env*
.gitignore
.gitattributes
LICENSE
mvnw.cmd
**/mvnw.cmd
.idea/
.vscode/
**/*.iml
.DS_Store
